Upstream sources
----------------

- AviumUI: https://github.com/AviumUI/android_manifests (branch avium-16.2)
- Waydroid: https://github.com/waydroid
- AOSP/LineageOS: as pinned by the locked manifest

This repository does not contain Android source code; all source is
fetched from the upstream repositories listed above.
